{"name":"Surgical Strike","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"surgical-strike","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>The robot companion Strides and then makes a blade Strike. If it hits, and the robot companion was undetected, the target takes an additional 1d6 precision damage (2d6 if the robot companion is burly or deft). If it was undetected at the start of its Surgical Strike, it remains undetected until after the Strike.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#agile-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["traversal"],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"agile-chassis","itemKind":"robot-maneuver"}},"_id":"79785e828bada3da"}
{"name":"Disturbing Display","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"disturbing-display","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>The robot companion morphs its features to reveal the machinery writhing beneath its synthetic skin. It attempts to Demoralize a creature using Deception instead of Intimidation. This display gains the visual trait and does not require a language. While frightened by this ability, the target is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard} to your robot companion.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#imitator-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"imitator-chassis","itemKind":"robot-maneuver"}},"_id":"0cfd3213c32db950"}
{"name":"Hydraulic Flipper","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"hydraulic-flipper","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>The robot companion makes a melee Strike. On a successful hit, it knocks the target @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{prone}.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#powerful-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"powerful-chassis","itemKind":"robot-maneuver"}},"_id":"dd283e061d740077"}
{"name":"Blinding Spotlight","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"blinding-spotlight","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>The robot companion shines a powerful spotlight on a creature it can see within 60 feet. The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{dazzled} until the end of your next turn or until it uses the Avert Gaze action, whichever comes first. This Points Out the creature if it was undetected by you or one or more of your allies.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#surveillance-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["light"],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"surveillance-chassis","itemKind":"robot-maneuver"}},"_id":"4eaed25b6e3955a7"}
{"name":"Ram Slam","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"ram-slam","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>The robot companion Strides in a straight line and makes a battering ram Strike. If it moved at least 20 feet and the Strike hits, the target is pushed back 10 feet.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#tank-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["traversal"],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"tank-chassis","itemKind":"robot-maneuver"}},"_id":"63fd30aef2073017"}
